<figure><img alt=\"驅蚊｜8種人最易成蚊叮對象！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240712/888413736069632000742635.jpeg/FvQXAzxmI6ahYKinbQy_d_xmMW2bLnqi6n_OWep_zlk\"/><figcaption>驅蚊｜8種人最易成蚊叮對象！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「快科技」授權轉載，微信公眾號：mydrivers】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T02:18:58.667580+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1649,"images":31,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}